    "canonical_ref": "GregNyss.Let.3",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "At Easter not only they who are transformed by the grace of the laver, i.e. baptism, but they who are penitents and converts, are to be brought to God, i.e. to the Communion: for Easter is that Catholic feast in which there is a resurrection from the fall of sin.",
